9
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:15,880
You leave me a life

10
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,400
From now on you are my master

11
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,640
I will never betray again

12
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:20,280
you won't betray again

13
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,680
thank you master

14
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,640
I will be your dog from now on
